Feature: Persistence

  @fixme
  Scenario: Todos survive a reload
    Given I Visit "/"
    And I Add "buy some cheese"
    And I Add "feed the cat"
    When I Tick the Todo "buy some cheese"
    And I Reload
    Then I should See "feed the cat"
    And the Checkbox "Toggle Todo" Within the Todo "buy some cheese" should be Checked
    But the Checkbox "Toggle Todo" Within the Todo "feed the cat" should Not be Checked
